{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>StarNomads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship. Gather resources. Build weapons. Upgrade. Colonize planets. Protect your mothership. Destroy your enemies. In this Real-Time Strategy, Turn-Based, Roguelike game, you command a spaceship seeking to colonize various planets with hostile environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, gather resources, build weapons and equipment, and make various upgrades that can take you further and further. The demo version includes <strong>3 planets</strong> to explore, while the full game will feature <strong>12 planets</strong> with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302640/extras/8e378c77a9fbdd0d3bfc407e62f4871a.avif?t=1762535380\" width=800 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op with up to four players, or in arena mode with up to eight players in frantic battles for planet colonization and resource domination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets feature varied environments with unique obstacles. A new challenge every round. Build your strategy based on the obstacles ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship and weapon upgrades are limitless. Create strategies based on long-range damage, close-range combat, movement speed, or a mix of everything.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3302640?t=1762535380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302640/c57f5d0f654e7d5cfa2d082f5ac29c885a8adc6c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762535380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.s